Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 12:43:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 13/13] Record 0.3.0 release checks and move the 0.2.0 patch
 series

Regenerate the release evidence with the 0.3.0 CLI and the wheel built
from the extracted 0.3.0 sdist in a fresh CPython 3.12 environment:
capabilities, CLI request, native sweep, independent validation,
installed checks, release checks with the tutorial and manual blocks,
two identical campaign manifest runs and the SciPy search. Keep the
0.2.0 release evidence under evidence/release-0.2.0/ and summarize the
0.3.0 checks under evidence/release-0.3.0/. Move the 0.2.0 patch files
to patches/0.2.0/; the 0.2.0 performance log is kept unchanged and its
patches/*.patch instruction now refers to that directory.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
